{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is divided into two processes, 10 minutes before the development stage, 10 minutes after the challenge stage, only the hunter who survived the challenge stage can take away the treasure</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A wide variety of weapons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons in the game are divided into basic/melee/range/missiles/projectiles and other weapon types, and the difference between physical and magic properties, is also divided into savage/blood/lightning and other genres, you can choose more different types of weapons, with their own attack methods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151420/extras/88b52268b11fbe9efef1abb56899dbbe.poster.avif?t=1770890438\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151420/extras/88b52268b11fbe9efef1abb56899dbbe.webm?t=1770890438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151420/extras/88b52268b11fbe9efef1abb56899dbbe.mp4?t=1770890438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enhance your weapon for special effects</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades can obtain strengthening points to strengthen weapons, and there is a probability of obtaining weapon effects, forming the key to construction. Depending on the special effects, choose more suitable skills and treasures. Some weapons have effects that can interact with other weapons, some can enhance the weapon itself based on attributes, and some can increase character attributes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Example: Savage Hammer - One of the weapon effects: The maximum health can be added to the damage and scope of the weapon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151420/extras/7f7499d6cd596e88d406dcbc3a66a04a.poster.avif?t=1770890438\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151420/extras/7f7499d6cd596e88d406dcbc3a66a04a.webm?t=1770890438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151420/extras/7f7499d6cd596e88d406dcbc3a66a04a.mp4?t=1770890438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade to unlock featured skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You gain skills when your weapon reaches a certain level. A type of skill that enhances one type of weapon, a type of growth skill that continuously increases its stat, and a type of skill that gains another stat based on one stat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151420/extras/86c4b7e6609f479aea7c39ee2c6b0f22.poster.avif?t=1770890438\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151420/extras/86c4b7e6609f479aea7c39ee2c6b0f22.webm?t=1770890438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3151420/extras/86c4b7e6609f479aea7c39ee2c6b0f22.mp4?t=1770890438\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find treasure chests to fight enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find treasure chests scattered around the map surrounded by monsters, different treasure chests have different treasures, the more precious treasure chests need to open longer. Fight against increasingly powerful enemies with treasures and weapons in the chest, and only the last hunter alive will be able to take his unique treasure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>"